  "kind": "extracted",
  "note": "legacy pre-flattening blocks: state = (block_id << 4) | meta, and the name is the version's OWN registry key (wool, log, stone_slab), not a 1.13 flattened identifier. Only meta-0 rows are carried, and that is sufficient: JavaGameData.BuildBlocks widens each block's state range to the whole nibble ((id<<4) .. (id<<4)|15) because the identity formula above already determines which block owns a state. Per-meta variant NAMING is deliberately not attempted; the nibble is exposed through BlockState.LegacyMeta. shared/legacy-block-meta.json is a curated sample of per-meta flattened names that nothing reads (there is no DataGen merge; an earlier revision of this note claimed one)."
 },
